{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME STRUCTURED FOR MULTIPLE GAME MODES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/extras/b8c2c45677df922e4d19278123c85814.avif?t=1759725975\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4Wheel Challenge</strong> is a single-player <strong>offline</strong> game structured to feature multiple game modes, each bringing unique challenges and distinct gameplay styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the main mode is <strong>TenLevels</strong> \u2014 a series of progressively challenging stages that test your precision, reflexes, and total control of the wheelchair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>TENLEVELS \u2014 THE MAIN CHALLENGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/extras/1092dbf5ea6b2c54001b752f08f0640c.avif?t=1759725975\" width=1560 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome obstacles, platforms, and ramps across 10 levels full of challenges. Show your skill and master every course to the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCORING SYSTEM \u2014 FROM \u201cF\u201d TO \u201cA\u201d, AIM FOR THE LEGENDARY \u201cS\u201d RANK!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/extras/a8b0c609124827c4410de3bfba03cc8c.avif?t=1759725975\" width=1560 height=283 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is graded based on your performance. Improve your time, avoid falls, and reach the highest score possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>HIGHLIGHTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Precise and responsive gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Vibrant low-poly visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Intense and progressive challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fully offline and single-player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 New free game modes every 3 months</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Do you have what it takes to earn an S rank on every level?</strong></i></u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504700?t=1759725975","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/d70d62fa84d8663e210da41a31fe60d333ee2fb3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759725975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/36219cdfd6bf0835448e4bb5ada632c353521f2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759725975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/36219cdfd6bf0835448e4bb5ada632c353521f2a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759725975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME STRUCTURED FOR MULTIPLE GAME MODES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504700/extras/b8c2c45677df922e4d19278123c85814.avif?t=1759725975\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4Wheel Challenge</strong> is a single-player <strong>offline</strong> game structure